{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bde5a1f3-5361-8751-a94a-944316c98cbc",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:45:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um, I'm calling about a tree limb. It came down partway after the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. It's still hanging over the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hanging over the sidewalk. Is it fully down or is it stuck up in the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stuck, mostly. It's cracked off and it's hanging by a piece. People walk right under it. It's my mom's house, I'm just calling for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "284 Kay Street. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "284 Kay Street, limb hanging over the sidewalk, from the storm. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So who do I call about that, exactly? Is it the city, or is it my mom's job, or the electric company? I honestly don't know who handles it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. If it's a city street tree, that's us. If it's on private property, it's usually the owner's. The utility only comes if it's on the wires. Is it touching any wires?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I don't think so. It's off to the side of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a report and a crew can look at whose tree it is. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:45-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0150. Somebody will check it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Sorry, I'm a little distracted. I have a book report due today on a biography, and I haven't even picked a book yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with that. Take care."
    }
  ],
